358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (         This book is written to help students and new researchers learn how to write a research proposal step by step. It explains every part of a proposal in easy language so that anyone can understand and follow it. You will learn how to choose a topic, find the research problem, write your objectives, plan your methods, and clearly organize your proposal. Each chapter gives short examples, helpful tips, and simple templates you can use for your own work. You do not need to be an expert to use this book. It is made for beginners who want to learn and improve their writing skills. You can read the whole book from start to end, or you can open any chapter when you need help.  )
/E (         This book is written to help students and new researchers learn how to write a research proposal step by step. It explains every part of a proposal in easy language so that anyone can understand and follow it. You will learn how to choose a topic, find the research problem, write your objectives, plan your methods, and clearly organize your proposal. Each chapter gives short examples, helpful tips, and simple templates you can use for your own work. You do not need to be an expert to use this book. It is made for beginners who want to learn and improve their writing skills. You can read the whole book from start to end, or you can open any chapter when you need help.  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
