/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (1.1 What Is a Research Proposal?           A research proposal is a short plan that explains what you want to study, why it is important, and how you will do it. It is like a map that shows the direction of your research. Your proposal tells others that you have a good idea, you understand the topic, and you know how to do the study. It helps your supervisor or funding body decide whether your plan is clear and possible.)
/E (1.1 What Is a Research Proposal?           A research proposal is a short plan that explains what you want to study, why it is important, and how you will do it. It is like a map that shows the direction of your research. Your proposal tells others that you have a good idea, you understand the topic, and you know how to do the study. It helps your supervisor or funding body decide whether your plan is clear and possible.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
